<code>assert !this.empty() => \result == this.get(this.size() - 1);</code>

This assert statement captures the logic that if the stack is not empty, the result of `peek()` should be equal to the last item in the stack. Since the stack cannot be empty when `peek()` is called (as it would throw an exception), the condition `!this.empty()` ensures that we are only considering the case where the stack has elements.
